#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3579
msgid ""
"Every product above is a standalone Wbcom plugin. BuddyNext detects each one "
"and lights up the matching features automatically when it is active."
msgstr ""
"위의 모든 제품은 독립형 Wbcom 플러그인입니다. BuddyNext는 각 플러그인을 감지"
