#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3600
msgid "Premium BuddyX with deeper layout, header, and community controls."
msgstr ""
"레이아웃, 헤더, 커뮤니티 제어 기능을 더 세밀하게 갖춘 프리미엄 BuddyX예요."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:3603 includes/Admin/Settings.php:3610
